    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "reconnecting doesn't feel real though. it feels like trying to fix a broken vase that's been crushed to dust. i look in the mirror and i'm just looking at a ghost. the person who lived, the one who felt alive and mattered... that version of me is dead. i'm just the leftovers of a life that's already over.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
